repository-code: https://github.com/lebedeffson/railway-vision-robustness
url: https://github.com/lebedeffson/railway-vision-robustness
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research on person detection, temporal tracking, false-alarm
  trade-offs, and track-fragment association in railway video scenes. The
  prospectively frozen B7-SCF hypothesis did not pass its scientific or
  operational gates; the sealed test was not opened.
keywords:
  - railway computer vision
  - person detection
  - temporal tracking
  - track-fragment association
  - negative result
